    {
      "name": "@luochbiao/dsh-git-branch-switcher",
      "title": {
        "en": "Git Branch Switcher",
        "zh": "Git 分支切换器"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Keep your git workflow inside the chat. A composer chip shows the current branch at a glance; the TRAE-style popup (or a docked side panel) lets you switch or create branches, fetch remotes, commit & push a subset of changes, merge branches with a clear source → target flow, stash / restore partial changes, and inspect diffs — all without leaving DeepSeek Harness. Popovers dock above the composer so your draft stays visible, and the change list opens instantly.",
        "zh": "让 git 操作不离开 DSH 聊天窗口。输入框工具行的胶囊实时显示当前分支；TRAE 风格弹层（或可停靠的右侧侧栏）一键切换/新建分支、同步远端、勾选改动提交推送、按来源 → 目标流向合并分支、暂存与恢复部分改动、查看工作区 diff。所有面板停靠在输入框上方，不遮挡草稿；改动列表秒开，工作区不干净时先确认再操作。"
      },
      "icon": "data:image/svg+xml;base64,",
      "author": "LuoBiao (milestone-17)",
      "homepage": "https://github.com/milestone-17/dsh-git-branch-switcher#readme",
